6905", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031518_1113760809920238_374040494887525675_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gRe_IIuqGZ4Q7kNvwE8-OxW&_nc_oc=AdpigcVr_0jgdg6ivDP3FtFK3fvrSVPLWqpL60odVk2E6HD6-gGzfDWWHLkypDucP1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE6S6Cj6bLbm-rqdIrOxTm-bu4Pzw4uRq2S9bnvH22XUQ&oe=6A7DC645"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-1.png", "id": "832532242169712", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031457_832532248836378_3663210356497322076_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7LfarqNRyM8Q7kNvwGE0WBw&_nc_oc=AdrF4QUhwNQEla7_1A3x2VvPRt4xVY46f4aVavOC-eTmnZ4Vv7e-MNGeaUsuvFdMBn4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFYbdk7mdlx24dm5LZmWD5F3PuXRuW52vujKlL5C90Jxg&oe=6A7DC811"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Shotta video cover.png", "id": "998125558115830", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974670_998125561449163_5721044183343334113_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M7MOrxPpV2gQ7kNvwEcAOAy&_nc_oc=Adqkb_gk19pf7wmizsRm52j49cqISX7hw_gOCso6d9uawKh-NAXOhDc7Z7GC2TXHQOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHKt8yipaK2TDB6-p5-AJkvXS95RM0UrnhQz7bolx6JLA&oe=6A7DAE0B"}, "display_name": "No Games - Drum & Bass Music Studio", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed producer Erb n Dub. \n\nMix and match hard-hitting drum sounds to generate the perfect DNB beat. Compose wicked and wild bass lines by moving the controllers around, adding hair-raising effects, all on top of Harry Shotta's classic jump-up style rap virtuosity.\n\nPlay solo or with up to 15 friends to have your own virtual DNB rave in VR!", "short_description": "Play incredible Drum & Bass live in multiplayer, with the sounds of UK rapper Harry Shotta and acclaimed produce